1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,912
What if Claude could actually

2
00:00:01,912 --> 00:00:02,890
call your phone?

3
00:00:02,890 --> 00:00:04,357
Here's how to connect it

4
00:00:04,357 --> 00:00:04,993
using MCP.

5
00:00:05,393 --> 00:00:07,160
First, open Bland AI and

6
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:08,456
create an account.

7
00:00:08,456 --> 00:00:10,576
It's a platform for AI-powered

8
00:00:10,576 --> 00:00:11,459
voice calls.

9
00:00:11,759 --> 00:00:13,025
You can sign in with

10
00:00:13,025 --> 00:00:13,950
a phone number,

11
00:00:13,950 --> 00:00:14,874
Google, or SSO.

12
00:00:15,274 --> 00:00:17,913
Next, open Bland's MCP integration

13
00:00:17,913 --> 00:00:20,025
page and copy its official

14
00:00:20,025 --> 00:00:20,948
server URL.

15
00:00:21,248 --> 00:00:22,436
It's a hosted server,

16
00:00:22,436 --> 00:00:24,082
so there's nothing to install.

17
00:00:24,482 --> 00:00:25,713
Now open Claude,

18
00:00:25,713 --> 00:00:26,944
go to Customize,

19
00:00:26,944 --> 00:00:28,114
then Connectors.

20
00:00:28,114 --> 00:00:29,838
Add a custom connector,

21
00:00:29,838 --> 00:00:31,193
name it Bland AI,

22
00:00:31,193 --> 00:00:32,916
and paste the MCP URL.

23
00:00:33,216 --> 00:00:35,683
Claude shows its authentication settings.

24
00:00:35,683 --> 00:00:37,362
Review them, then continue.

25
00:00:37,762 --> 00:00:38,977
Sign in to Bland,

26
00:00:38,977 --> 00:00:40,577
choose your organization,

27
00:00:40,577 --> 00:00:42,344
and review the permissions.

28
00:00:42,344 --> 00:00:44,275
Now Claude can access Bland's

29
00:00:44,275 --> 00:00:45,324
available tools.

30
00:00:45,624 --> 00:00:46,900
For read-only access,

31
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:48,839
uncheck the permission to change

32
00:00:48,839 --> 00:00:49,604
your agents.

33
00:00:49,904 --> 00:00:51,064
Prefer Claude Code?

34
00:00:51,064 --> 00:00:52,526
Add the server with one

35
00:00:52,526 --> 00:00:53,836
command, then log in.

36
00:00:54,236 --> 00:00:55,095
Let's test it.

37
00:00:55,095 --> 00:00:56,479
Ask Claude to list your

38
00:00:56,479 --> 00:00:57,243
Bland agents.

39
00:00:57,243 --> 00:00:58,102
If it answers,

40
00:00:58,102 --> 00:00:59,056
you're connected.

41
00:00:59,356 --> 00:01:00,921
Placing a real call needs

42
00:01:00,921 --> 00:01:02,788
your approval, your own number,

43
00:01:02,788 --> 00:01:03,898
and Bland credits.

44
00:01:04,298 --> 00:01:05,710
You can use this for

45
00:01:05,710 --> 00:01:08,427
reminders, confirmations, and other approved

46
00:01:08,427 --> 00:01:09,241
phone tasks.

47
00:01:09,241 --> 00:01:11,523
Calling features may require credits

48
00:01:11,523 --> 00:01:12,609
or a paid plan.

49
00:01:13,009 --> 00:01:14,418
Save this tutorial,

50
00:01:14,418 --> 00:01:16,194
share it with a friend,

51
00:01:16,194 --> 00:01:18,460
and follow Agentoon.ai for more

52
00:01:18,460 --> 00:01:19,195
AI tools!
